(a) Critically examine the different genres in EMI classrooms: semantics, semiotics, rhetorical structures, text knowledge of Personal, Social and Humanities Educations KLAs;
(b) Organisation of interactive activities in EMI classrooms to tailor different learning needs - students with different language proficiencies and learning abilities in developing subject-specific English proficiency;
