en.objective:
This workshop is an introduction to designing co-curricular activities (CCA) onsite (face-face mode) and/or online (distance learning). You will learn how to plan and draft a proposal, and prepare and implement effective co-curricular activities. If you already have experience, especially teaching online, you will have the opportunity to view different types of CCA in action in Hong Kong schools. You will get additional ideas for your next CCA.
In this course, teachers will:
define co-curricular activities (CCA);
understand the pedagogies and the links between CCA and the curriculum;
explore equipment, tools and resources by watching CCA in action in Hong Kong schools; and
apply the understanding of the features of an effective CCA programme design to create your own proposal.

