en.objective:
This workshop will help teachers identify students' challenges in learning English and provide proactive support by utilising a variety of evidence-based teaching approaches, strategies, and tools.
In this workshop, teachers will
identify students' specific needs through diagnostic pre-assessment;
use assessment tools to compile data and record progress;
explore intervention strategies and possible support tools;
analyse a practical example of a hypothetical student; and
utilise task components to support the chosen hypothetical student.

