en.objective:
This workshop offers various approaches for cross-curricular collaboration and integration of ELE and STEAM learning and teaching for KS1 and KS2.
This online workshop provides opportunities for teachers to:
become aware of the rationale behind integrating ELE with STEAM;
understand some of the potential challenges faced by teachers when integrating ELE with STEAM, as well as looking at strategies to overcome these;
explore a variety of approaches to the integration of ELE and STEAM; and
apply knowledge gained from the workshop to demonstrate your ability to meet student needs through planning an integrated ELE and STEAM activity.

