en.objective:
*The workshop was formerly known as "Using Epic School".
This workshop considers the use of e-book streaming services as a tool that allows teachers to select and assign English texts to students in or out of the physical classroom. Participants will be able to view the platform from both the perspective of primary school teachers and the students who would be using it.
Participants sign into Epic School, and via links in this workshop, are led through the various functions of Epic School step by step.
This online workshop provides opportunities for teachers to:
become familiar with a digital platform that provides access to online multi-modal English texts;
