en.objective:
Upon successful completion of this programme, participants will be able to:
1. understand and explain the key theories and principles of generative AI (GenAI) tools , including the ethical considerations and responsible use, as well as their implications for designing curriculum materials and assessment tasks;
2. plan, design, and implement approaches integrated with GenAI-tools to develop curriculum materials and assessment tasks that effectively address diverse student learning needs and promote information literacy;
3. critically evaluate the effectiveness and ethical impact of GenAI tools in enhancing curriculum delivery and assessment practices, and make informed decisions regarding their sustainable integration in teaching.

