en.objective:
This Key Learning Area (KLA) Specific Programme aims to develop teachers’ specialised knowledge and classroom skills required to teach their content subjects effectively through English.
By the end of the programme, participants should be able to:
1. demonstrate an enhanced understanding of aspects of rationale for and principles underlying English medium education in Hong Kong;
2. demonstrate an enhanced understanding of the role of language in learning;
3. demonstrate an awareness of a range of strategies for effective planning and classroom teaching and learning of their own subject through English;
4. demonstrate enhanced knowledge and skills using English as the medium of instruction in their own subject.

